---
// Static figure. Styling comes from the ".fig" rules in src/styles/global.css.
---
<svg class="fig" viewBox="0 0 720 270" role="img" aria-labelledby="jm-title jm-desc">
  <title id="jm-title">What is inside an integrated rotary joint module</title>
  <desc id="jm-desc">Along one axis, from back to front: brake, motor-side encoder, frameless motor with stator and rotor, gear reducer, torque sensor, output encoder and output flange. A drive board sits on the back and a hollow shaft runs through the centre for cables.</desc>
  <!-- hollow shaft -->
  <rect x="96" y="112" width="560" height="26" rx="4" fill="none" class="axis" stroke-dasharray="6 5" />
  <text x="376" y="129" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">hollow shaft — cables pass through the joint</text>

  <rect class="soft4" x="20" y="60" width="62" height="130" rx="8" />
  <text x="51" y="212" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-strong">Drive</text>
  <text x="51" y="227" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">inverter,</text>
  <text x="51" y="241" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">FOC, bus</text>

  <rect class="box" x="96" y="70" width="54" height="36" rx="6" /><rect class="box" x="96" y="144" width="54" height="36" rx="6" />
  <text x="123" y="212" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-strong">Brake</text>
  <text x="123" y="227" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">holds when</text>
  <text x="123" y="241" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">unpowered</text>

  <rect class="box" x="162" y="78" width="30" height="28" rx="5" /><rect class="box" x="162" y="144" width="30" height="28" rx="5" />
  <text x="177" y="212" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-strong">Encoder</text>
  <text x="177" y="227" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">rotor</text>
  <text x="177" y="241" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">angle</text>

  <rect class="soft1" x="206" y="40" width="150" height="34" rx="6" /><rect class="soft1" x="206" y="176" width="150" height="34" rx="6" />
  <rect class="f1" x="206" y="80" width="150" height="26" rx="5" opacity="0.75" /><rect class="f1" x="206" y="144" width="150" height="26" rx="5" opacity="0.75" />
  <text x="281" y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small">stator (windings)</text>
  <text x="281" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small" style="fill: var(--surface)">rotor (magnets)</text>
  <text x="281" y="232" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-strong">Frameless motor</text>
  <text x="281" y="247" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">torque from current</text>

  <rect class="soft3" x="370" y="48" width="118" height="58" rx="6" /><rect class="soft3" x="370" y="144" width="118" height="58" rx="6" />
  <text x="429" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small">gear stage(s)</text>
  <text x="429" y="224" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-strong">Reducer</text>
  <text x="429" y="239" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">planetary · strain wave</text>
  <text x="429" y="253" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">· cycloidal</text>

  <rect class="soft2" x="502" y="58" width="44" height="48" rx="6" /><rect class="soft2" x="502" y="144" width="44" height="48" rx="6" />
  <text x="524" y="212" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-strong">Torque</text>
  <text x="524" y="227" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-strong">sensor</text>
  <text x="524" y="241" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">(optional)</text>

  <rect class="box" x="560" y="78" width="30" height="28" rx="5" /><rect class="box" x="560" y="144" width="30" height="28" rx="5" />
  <text x="578" y="212" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-strong">Encoder</text>
  <text x="578" y="227" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">joint</text>
  <text x="578" y="241" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">angle</text>

  <rect class="box" x="604" y="40" width="52" height="66" rx="6" /><rect class="box" x="604" y="144" width="52" height="66" rx="6" />
  <text x="640" y="232" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-strong">Output</text>
  <text x="640" y="247" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">to the link</text>
  <path class="axis" d="M664 125 H700 M692 118 L700 125 L692 132" />
</svg>
